ia und rhombifolia.\n — g〉 Cucumis utilissimus RĀJAN. 6,52. BHĀVAPR. 1,168.\n — h〉 = एर्वारु RĀJAN. 7,204.\n — i〉 eine Art Valeriana, = गन्धमांसी RĀJAN. 12,101.\n — k〉 eine Art Crotolaria RĀJAN. 4,67.\n — l〉 eine best. Heilpflanze, = महामदा.\n — m〉 Veilchenwurzel, = वचा.\n — n〉 Eisenvitriol.\n — o〉 N. pr. einer Śākinī.\n— 5〉 f. ई Titel einer Śikṣā PRATIJÑĀS.^2\n— 6〉 n. ein best. Metrum.\n[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk, Thomas Malten on 20241207. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/PWK/issues/111.\n[2] Correction submitted by Dhaval Patel, Jim Funderburk. on 20160107. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/CORRECTIONS/issues/236. note: There are 7 occurrences of both. pwbib0.txt has kept the later. So changing for consistency..", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["लोमशः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["lomaSaH"]}, {"id": "lomASa", "headword": "लोमाश", "headword_slp1": "lomASa", "fold": "lomasa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "लोमाश m. Schakal oder Fuchs.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["लोमाशः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["lomASaH"]}], "lomasakarRa": [{"id": "lomaSakarRa", "headword": "लोमशकर्ण", "headword_slp1": "lomaSakarRa", "fold": "lomasakarRa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "लोमशकर्ण m. ein best. Höhlen bewohnendes Thier.", "gloss_language": "de"}], "synonyms": ["लोमशकर्णः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["lomaSakarRaH"]}], "lomasakaRqa": [{"id": "lomaSakARqA", "headword": "लोमशकाण्डा", "headword_slp1": "lomaSakARqA", "fold": "lomasakaRqa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "bohtlingk-sanskrit-worterbuch-in-kurzerer-fassung", "senses": [{"gloss": "*लोमशकाण्डा f. Cucumis utilissimus RĀJAN. 7,199.", "gloss_language": "de"}]}], "lomasapatrika": [{"id": "lomaSapattrikA", "headword": "लोमशपत्त्रिका", "headword_slp1": "lomaSapattrikA", "fold": "lomasapatrika", "headword_language": "sa", "sou